      "content": "\"let the water\" isn't helping. it just feels like drowning. everything i was supposed to be, every expectation from my family, my department... it's all just a massive, humiliating lie now. the more i think about it, the more it seems like the kindest thing to do is just to let go. not even out of anger, just because it feels like the only way to stop the noise and the shame. why fight for a life that has no foundation left? it seems so much more rational to just exit.",
